{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f36c1b06626a5648da6dbb99e1655b86a004699d52711c4ef0b92101d330ff51", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画で、\n真美は『ネコ』がテーマの謎解きゲームに挑戦中だ）", "zh": "（在角色扮演写真企划中，真美正在挑战以“猫”为主题的解谜游戏）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "a96a79115599054cb22c41cebb5f207356e634eeb67386704b7237ac4e4bd514", "ja": "うにゃ～ん……。\nにゃーにゃん、にゃにゃんにゃーい！", "zh": "喵呜～……  \n喵喵，喵喵喵～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "93dcbc84b965c5799a7ea4675f1a0d276eca714c5bb7b08ff7b6ecf35de5fd86", "ja": "……もしかして、\n「兄ちゃん、わかんない！」って言ったのか？", "zh": "……难道说，\n你刚才说的是“兄长，我不懂啦！”吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "cdf278c50e4d1ed475917768849e9192d4ba6c8ea7b51e2b86ca32931a33ddfa", "ja": "おお、大正解～♪　さっすが兄ちゃん！\n真美がネコになっても、バッチリンコだね♪", "zh": "哦，大正确～♪不愧是哥哥！\n就算真美变成了猫，也完全难不倒哥哥呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "c8667a1b3458f7c9b3055928aa823329f862b327d4bfc94c9b6e43fd02524a63", "ja": "そんじゃ、名探偵兄ちゃんくん！　あとは任せた～。\nさ～て、ネコ真美はベンチでお昼寝ターイム♪", "zh": "那么，名侦探哥哥！接下来就拜托你啦～  \n接下来～猫咪真美要在长椅上睡午觉啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1cb6d37c2fddda25099b9908a0571977c37ef47d83709b775ef61586a5fb3994", "ja": "おーい！　サボろうったって、そうはいかないぞ！\n真美が解いてるところも、撮影したいんだから。", "zh": "喂！想偷懒可没那么容易！我还想拍下真美解谜的样子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "261f7e00d1d4eac1b56092874ef5a5908761feda92320e974031dac778b72d3b", "ja": "むー、でも～……。真美、ゲームは好きだけどさ。\nこういう謎解きって、みんなでやるもんじゃないのー？", "zh": "唔——可是……真美虽然喜欢游戏啦。\n但这种解谜，不是应该大家一起玩吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1007_p", "source_sha256": "59d24790c9041d52d44a8f598a3b5113acab6840fa3a799f679b2849c88187ec", "ja": "とも限らないけど……まあ、わからなくもないな。", "zh": "也不能说一定是这样，不过……嗯，我也不是不能理解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "6cb010e05850726d95d02e3d640b3116d8321898472605303e3d140786bcbf8c", "ja": "真美ひとりでやっても、つまんなーい！\n亜美だっていないし。誰かいないかなー……チラッ。", "zh": "真美一个人做的话，好无聊啊——！\n而且亚美也不在。有没有人在呢——……偷偷瞄一眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7f3ef59cc214e0d38d14df24ccc52a69f6b83c9ec9d1ea051b8c10debec4360b", "ja": "俺か……。", "zh": "我吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "9dfd6d20949660926376164ac7f143ccdfd04e4f8706083e18b22126f5a79ba8", "ja": "てことで、兄ちゃん一緒によろー♪\n猫に小判！　真美には兄ちゃん！　って言うでしょ？", "zh": "所以说，哥哥，接下来就一起加油啦♪  \n猫咪拿小判！真美就该有哥哥！不是都这么说嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b73a705d927e46c2350e13bce0f444dd6fe8b1afa8ca4b12674534a960704bb3", "ja": "それだと、俺は役に立たないけど……。ま、いいか。\n撮影のためにも、問題を解かないといけないしな。", "zh": "那样的话，我就派不上用场了……不过，算了。\n为了拍摄，也得把问题解出来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "6f2b3c58d5bd16d485f3518aa496863d5dd0f5976f47c36e0968d11c4ce8cd88", "ja": "そゆコト！　頼りにしてるかんね、兄ちゃん♪\nそんじゃ問題いくよー……。", "zh": "就是这样！可就指望你了，哥哥♪\n那开始答题吧——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1013_null", "source_sha256": "7f8bbb5bc249de0ac12a5f84753aa5f143f67d79048178d3496e692f9da518b2", "ja": "1時間後……", "zh": "一个小时后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "8c2c6e63dae1fbe1d75b41abeba6f789810c0fc787a0b84d101bb5d50ccda558", "ja": "うあうあ～！　兄ちゃん、ここどーこー？\nなんで真美たち、閉じ込められてんの～！？", "zh": "呜啊呜啊～！哥哥，这里是哪儿～？\n为什么真美她们被关起来了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9ab815a132ee708cd6e477443b46c485829374c94eb1ca90b58531e3a5088934", "ja": "あれ？　おかしいな……。この部屋を\n脱出する仕掛けが、どこかにあると思うんだけど……。", "zh": "咦？奇怪了……我觉得这个房间里应该藏着什么逃出去的机关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "71aa5ef8a0a8ed164b0a5f10a8d0787857e5645f4d4134013037c1ad7ed2b417", "ja": "なるほどなるほど。どこかに隠しスペースが……\nむむっ？　ネコ真美の勘が囁いている。ここだ～っ！", "zh": "原来如此原来如此。这里肯定藏着什么秘密空间……\n唔唔？猫真美的直觉在告诉我。就是这里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1017_null", "source_sha256": "f352f0f076558451454522141fd193b0ad93b02508a028e4f6d482a38f70566c", "ja": "ガシャン！", "zh": "哐当！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "cbd310b874d3fa0b225f6ba953fd134d5c8d0beb5885156e170afa326e91f153", "ja": "あれれ？　テキトーに触ったらカギ開いちゃった……。\nさっすがネコ♪　んじゃ、真美だけ脱出にゃ～！", "zh": "咦？随便碰碰锁就开了……\n真不愧是猫咪♪那真美就先逃跑喵～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0483_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e750a8fb4457546e9fab2e13e055df038988bb972f88457dceabcc97b28e562d", "ja": "えっ？　はっ！？\n真美だけって！　人間を置いていくんじゃなーい！", "zh": "咦？哈！？\n什么叫只有真美！不能把人类丢下不管啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
